 right\u2014there IS something special on this island!", "summary": "Treasure Party combines match-3 puzzle gameplay with a unique board game-style adventure, offering a vibrant treasure hunting experience. Players guide their hero along the Treasure Trail, discovering mini-games, challenges, power-ups, and jackpot rewards with each roll of the die.\n\nWith fresh adventures in every region and social features for connecting with friends, Treasure Party is a fun, rewarding journey perfect for puzzle lovers and adventurers alike.", "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/treasure-party"}